  "description": "This is the all new Wicked Fat Chance!\n\nThis is also not yer Daddy’s Wicked. This is a full send, rough and tumble, no holds barred, gloves off rabble rouser, a low and slack Hardtail designed to rip your favorite flow trails. It’s the bike to load into the truck with a few more, next to a cooler of beverages, and go SEND IT. Last one down drives the next shuttle run!\n\nDesigned and brought to life by Chris Chance, the same mad scientist who created the bike many folks venerate, the celebrated Yo Eddy, this bike is perfect for fast, flowy, bermed trails and is very comfortable in the air. Whip it with confidence, brake late, accelerate hard out of corners and Send it!\n\nChris took everything he knows about the handling of the Yo, slacked out the head tube, steepened the seat tube and lengthened the top tube. With a 65º head tube angle this low and slack hard core hard tail is ready to rip. He also stiffened the chassis with oversized downtubes and compact frame design. With a lowered top tube and added seat mast strut, standover is good with longer travel (140-150mm) forks.\n\nThe Ti Wicked Fat is designed to rule the descents, but still climbs like a beast (Like a Yo Eddy...One that’s been doing hella push ups!). This bike is Hella Fat!",
